The upstream source is Apache-2.0; scripts/qwen3_gcad_port_LICENSE preserves
the license. See scripts/qwen3_gcad_port_NOTICE for the earlier port. No
standalone upstream NOTICE was supplied in the pinned source archive.
This is a derived-work attribution, not an upstream NOTICE or endorsement.

Changes for Qwen3.8: interventions limited to hybrid-model full-attention
blocks; capture native per-head norms and partial rotary position embeddings;
de-interleave native query/output-gate projections; include the native sigmoid
gate in cropped system contributions; accumulate response, pair, key and query
means in FP32; retain raw delta addition after the native output projection.
New geometry, cleanup and coverage checks accompany the prospective study.
